OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bosses push forward with
OL,4,Atown balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses are pushing ahead with
OL,7,Fplans to ban face coverings in
OL,8,FLoughborough town centre.
OL,10,FCharnwood Borough Council said it
OL,11,Fwanted to bring in new rules allowing
OL,12,F#100 penalties to be issued to people
OL,13,Fwho conceal their identity with
OL,14,Fscarves, masks and balaclavas while
OL,15,Fcommitting crime and anti-social
OL,16,Fbehaviour.
OL,18,FThe Labour-run authority said the move
OL,19,Fwould not apply to coverings worn for
OL,20,Freligious, cultural or medical reasons.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
