OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bosses push forward with
OL,4,Atown balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's cabinet last night said
OL,7,Fit would run a 28-day public
OL,8,Fconsultation on the proposal but that
OL,9,Fit aimed to bring in the new rule early
OL,10,Fin 2027.
